/* fonts.css - font data for the page and the type shelf.
 * Generated by the mirror build from the @font-face rules in the page source;
 * each font file is inlined (latin subset, weight 400, normal + italic where the
 * family has one). Browsers download nothing until a face is actually used.
 * This file is data - read index.css and app.js for how faces are applied. */

